    "default_scope": "banner",
    "description": "Conformance validation-surface reference. Same two surfaces as ref-scope-1, but each surface owns a required category: level is required and unscoped, so the banner surface and the whole marking demand it; authority is required and scoped to 'alt', so only the alternate surface demands it. Lets a case say which surface a fragment is and pin what that surface demands, instead of judging every fragment as a whole marking.",
